WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.125
Watch and read: For your polite practice, what greeting fits sunrise?

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.982
The answer is: Good morning. Good morning is used at that time of day.

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:14.545
Watch and read: For your presentation practice, you are presenting on my family. What

00:00:14.545 --> 00:00:15.906
is the best answer?

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:21.498
The answer is: Face your audience. Read the instruction carefully and choose the

00:00:21.498 --> 00:00:22.949
helpful or correct response.
